          "type": "fetch",
          "target": "gs_q_webbed_crystal",
          "count": 5
        }
      ],
      "accept_text": "Every piece on this wall's fallen out of the sky and caught in the branches. The Silkwood Weavers down in the Silkwood on the Lower Boughs have been wrapping the crystal chips up like prey. Get me some of them, silk and all.",
      "turn_in_text": "Look at the cut on these. Every one the same angle, and every one still warm.\n\nThey're not jewels. They're parts of something, and whatever it is, it was running when it broke.",
