      "accept_text": "Tel'zan keeps the record of everything that's fallen from the sky, and he'll want to see this before it goes on the wall. Take it across the bridge to the scholars' hall at the Roost.",
      "turn_in_text": "That's the biggest piece anyone's brought me, and the record's three years long.\n\nThe pieces are getting bigger every month. Whatever's up there, it's coming apart faster than it was, and one day something a lot bigger than a crystal is going to fall on this city.",
