    {
      "quest_id": "gsq_the_wards_lanterns",
      "title": "The Ward's Lanterns",
      "giver_npc_id": "gs_ward_elder",
      "zone": "great_settlement",
      "level_min": 45,
      "level_max": 46,
      "description": "Grandmother Ozai's ward burns glimmer dust in its lanterns, which gives the light its gold. The lamplighters have run short, and the moths on the tiers below are the only place it comes from.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "fetch",
          "target": "gs_q_lantern_dust",
          "count": 8
        }
      ],
      "accept_text": "Our lanterns burn with a pinch of glimmer dust in the oil, and that's why the ward glows gold at night. Little Jinto's run out. The Glimmerwing Moths along the trunk ledge below Mossroof carry it on their wings, so bring some back for him.",
      "turn_in_text": "That'll keep the ward gold for a month.\n\nJinto says if a lantern goes out, the loa can't find its way home. I told him that myself, when he was small. I'm not sure I believed it then, but I do now.",
      "next_quest_id": null,
