      "zone": "great_settlement",
      "level_min": 45,
      "level_max": 46,
      "description": "One of Bat Handler Ruzkah's bats flew down into the Silkwood in a storm and hasn't come back. She can hear it from the Roost at night, caught somewhere in the webs.",
