      "accept_text": "One of my bats went down into the Silkwood in last week's storm, and I can hear it calling at night from the webs. The Silkwood Weavers will have it wrapped by now if they haven't eaten it. Clear them out of the Silkwood and I'll go down and cut it loose.",
      "turn_in_text": "I found her this morning, wrapped up tight and furious about it. She bit me, which means she's fine.\n\nBats don't forget. She'll fly you anywhere you like, and she'll fly faster for you than she does for me.",
